ASoC: q6apm: connect native Denali FullIO PCM prepare

Prepare the once-only reference graph with PA/clock off, mute and SP/SPVI proof.
Start the DSP once and keep its buffer borrowed across repeated prepare; normal PCM START performs no DSP transaction.
Only the opt-in native card; all existing muted and audit fixtures retain their paths.
